/*
 * divide-witness.compact — constrain an off-chain division witness.
 *
 * Official sample (not an invented API):
 *   https://docs.midnight.network/examples/contracts/calculator
 * The page declares divMod as a witness and checks it in divide:
 *   assert(rem < num2 && quo * num2 + rem == num1, "incorrect division");
 * A witness return is prover-chosen. The assert is what rejects a lying quotient.
 *
 * Upstream: midnightntwrk/midnight-docs#1387
 * Compact reference pages are synced from LFDT-Minokawa/compact and still
 * lack a contract snippet for this pattern. This file does not edit those
 * pages. Does not fix the public indexer or node.
 *
 * Language pin: Compact ~0.31.1 / language ~0.23. Not compiled here.
 *
 * Built by @kshot9000 https://x.com/kshot9000
